* digital-partition characterization deck body, f_clk = 384.0000 MHz (issue #619)
* DUT = design/sar_sequencer subckt + the top-level sky130_fd_sc_hd glue,
* both copied verbatim from the committed design/sar_adc_top.spice.
* one solver thread per unit: concurrent units on a shared runner must not oversubscribe it
.options num_threads=1
.global VPWR VGND
.include $PDK_ROOT/sky130A/libs.ref/sky130_fd_sc_hd/spice/sky130_fd_sc_hd.spice

* --- rails: Vdig is the digital-rail ammeter (positive current = into the + pin) ---
Vdig VPWR 0 DC 1.8
Vgnd VGND 0 DC 0

* --- stimulus (ideal; energy outside the DUT boundary) ---
VCLKU CLKU 0 PULSE(0 1 1.302083e-09 1.302083e-10 1.302083e-10 1.171875e-09 2.604167e-09)
BCLK CLK 0 V = v(CLKU)*v(VPWR)
VRSTU RSTU 0 PWL(0.000000e+00 0.000000e+00 1.093750e-08 0.000000e+00 1.106771e-08 1.000000e+00 1.391927e-07 1.000000e+00)
BRST RST_B 0 V = v(RSTU)*v(VPWR)
VCMPU CMPU 0 PWL(0.000000e+00 0.000000e+00 1.236979e-08 0.000000e+00 1.250000e-08 1.000000e+00 1.757813e-08 1.000000e+00 1.770833e-08 0.000000e+00 2.278646e-08 0.000000e+00 2.291667e-08 1.000000e+00 2.539062e-08 1.000000e+00 2.552083e-08 0.000000e+00 2.799479e-08 0.000000e+00 2.812500e-08 1.000000e+00 3.059896e-08 1.000000e+00 3.072917e-08 0.000000e+00 3.320312e-08 0.000000e+00 3.333333e-08 1.000000e+00 4.361979e-08 1.000000e+00 4.375000e-08 0.000000e+00 4.622396e-08 0.000000e+00 4.635417e-08 1.000000e+00 4.882812e-08 1.000000e+00 4.895833e-08 0.000000e+00 5.403646e-08 0.000000e+00 5.416667e-08 1.000000e+00 5.664062e-08 1.000000e+00 5.677083e-08 0.000000e+00 5.924479e-08 0.000000e+00 5.937500e-08 1.000000e+00 6.184896e-08 1.000000e+00 6.197917e-08 0.000000e+00 6.445312e-08 0.000000e+00 6.458333e-08 1.000000e+00 7.747396e-08 1.000000e+00 7.760417e-08 0.000000e+00 8.007812e-08 0.000000e+00 8.020833e-08 1.000000e+00 8.268229e-08 1.000000e+00 8.281250e-08 0.000000e+00 8.528646e-08 0.000000e+00 8.541667e-08 1.000000e+00 8.789062e-08 1.000000e+00 8.802083e-08 0.000000e+00 9.049479e-08 0.000000e+00 9.062500e-08 1.000000e+00 9.309896e-08 1.000000e+00 9.322917e-08 0.000000e+00 9.570312e-08 0.000000e+00 9.583333e-08 1.000000e+00 9.830729e-08 1.000000e+00 9.843750e-08 0.000000e+00 1.113281e-07 0.000000e+00 1.114583e-07 1.000000e+00 1.139323e-07 1.000000e+00 1.140625e-07 0.000000e+00 1.165365e-07 0.000000e+00 1.166667e-07 1.000000e+00 1.191406e-07 1.000000e+00 1.192708e-07 0.000000e+00 1.217448e-07 0.000000e+00 1.218750e-07 1.000000e+00 1.243490e-07 1.000000e+00 1.244792e-07 0.000000e+00 1.269531e-07 0.000000e+00 1.270833e-07 1.000000e+00 1.295573e-07 1.000000e+00 1.296875e-07 0.000000e+00 1.391927e-07 0.000000e+00)
BCMP COMP_OUT 0 V = v(CMPU)*v(VPWR)
* OUTN_NC is the comparator's OUTN output in the integrated ADC; here a fixed DC 0.
VOUTN OUTN_NC 0 DC 0

* --- DUT ---
xseq DOUT9 PH_B9 CLK PH_B8 DOUT8 RST_B PH_B7 DOUT7 COMP_OUT DOUT6 PH_B6 PH_B5 DOUT5 DOUT4 PH_B4 DOUT3 PH_B3 DOUT2 PH_B2 PH_B1 DOUT1 PH_B0 DOUT0 PH_EOC PH_SAMPLE BUSY sar_sequencer
.subckt sar_sequencer DOUT9 PH_B9 CLK PH_B8 DOUT8 RST_B PH_B7 DOUT7 COMP_OUT DOUT6 PH_B6 PH_B5 DOUT5 DOUT4 PH_B4 DOUT3 PH_B3 DOUT2 PH_B2 PH_B1 DOUT1 PH_B0 DOUT0 PH_EOC PH_SAMPLE BUSY
